  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong>此版本僅適用於 1.20.4 - 1.21.1。此模組在 NeoForge 上的更新版本已<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-ocean-monuments\" rel=\"nofollow\">移至這裡</a>。</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4IgKuSq.png\" alt=\"YUNG's Better Ocean Monuments\" width=\"1344\" height=\"416\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsapibadge\" alt=\"需要 YUNG's API\" width=\"211\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/rns3beq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsdiscordbadge2\" alt=\"加入 Discord 上的 YUNG 幫派！\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungstwitterbadge3\" alt=\"在 Twitter 上追蹤我！\" width=\"76\" height=\"27\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmEhjcMNhSDTRJgjVfbs9Rw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsyoutubebadge\" alt=\"訂閱我的 YouTube 頻道！\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungspatreonbadge\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我！\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qs5CKD3.png\" alt=\"這是什麼？\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p><p>&nbsp;對 Minecraft 海洋遺蹟的全面改造！YUNG's Better Ocean Monuments 從根本上重新設計了海洋遺蹟，使其更具挑戰性且獎勵更豐厚。改良後的海洋遺蹟比原版建築大得多，且擁有完全隨機化的佈局。您將能在此找到更優質的戰利品，包括三叉戟與海洋之心！</p><p><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QavgJ5oL5SI?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/61NjpSv.png\" alt=\"相容性\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p><p>YUNG's Better Ocean Monuments 旨在與所有世界生成模組完全相容，包括：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-desert-temples-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Desert Temples</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-witch-huts-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Witch Huts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-extras-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Extras</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-bridges-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Bridges</a></li>\n<li>Terralith、Biomes O' Plenty、Oh The Biomes You'll Go 等</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2mVOWMC.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1230\" height=\"241\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a49IMQJ.png\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nQRs7ZP.png\" alt=\"在 Bisect Hosting 使用優惠碼 YUNGNICKYOUNG 可享 75 折優惠！\" width=\"1344\" height=\"400\"></a></p>",
